SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE

The MIT licence above covers the FTHR Clips source code written by the FTHR
Community and the media outputs enumerated in
licenses/FTHR-GENERATED-ASSETS.txt.

It does NOT cover the third-party components redistributed in the binary
builds. Those keep their own licences, some of which are copyleft:

  * FFmpeg .............. LGPL v3 or later   (dynamically linked)
  * Qt 6 ................ LGPL v3
  * PySide6 / Shiboken .. LGPL v3            (dynamically linked)
  * OpenCV .............. Apache-2.0
  * NumPy ............... BSD-3-Clause
  * sounddevice, keyboard  MIT
  * cffi ................. MIT No Attribution
  * pycparser ............ BSD-3-Clause
  * Oswald Bold 4.103 .... SIL Open Font License 1.1

See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for the complete list, versions, and the location
of every licence text. A downloadable build is the MIT-licensed FTHR code plus
separately licensed third-party components; it is not an MIT-only artifact.
